// libsodium cci.20220430 (1.0.18, conan-center-index recipes/libsodium).
// Every clause cites the installed sodium/*.h headers.
//
// Raw functions (genuinely unmodeled/unsafe by nature):
// - sodium_malloc, sodium_allocarray, sodium_free, sodium_mprotect_*: raw
//   guard-page allocator / memory-protection pointers with no typed size.
// - sodium_set_misuse_handler, randombytes_set_implementation: process-global
//   custom allocator/RNG callback tables.
// - Legacy NaCl padded APIs (crypto_secretbox, crypto_box) requiring leading
//   zero-padding bytes, and low-level curve/core/stream primitives whose
//   multi-pointer contracts are algorithm-specific.
